  "sourceTitle": "Fiber Muffins",
  "sourceText": "Fiber Muffins\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup flour\n cup brown sugar\n1 tablespoon baking powder\nsalt\n2 1/2 cups fiber cereal\n1/2 teaspoon cinnamon\n1 cup milk\n1 egg\n cup oil\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix flour, brown sugar, baking powder, salt, cereal and cinnamon. Add milk, egg, and oil. Bake in muffin papers.  Bake at 400 degrees for 25 minutes.\n\nAbout\n\n\nA delicious way to incorporate more fiber into your diet. Perfect as a quick breakfast or snack on the go.",
